                  The field is a marker stroke you type into. Focus sweeps
                  the highlighter across it, so you write ink on yellow;
                  answered fields keep the mark at half strength, so a
                  finished form reads as a marked-up page. Every field
                  carries its type icon on the left, its error or success
                  mark on the right. The dropdown, checkbox, and radio are
                  all ours, and fully keyboard-operable.
                  </p>
              </div>
              <div class="section_body">
                  <div class="form_grid">
                    <div class="field">
