              <div class="section_head">
                  <p class="eyebrow">Navigation</p>
                  <p class="section_lead text-small text-ink-muted max-w-measure-md">
                  Nav links are quiet ink; hover slides an accent underline
                  in from the left, and the current page is fully marked,
                  the same yellow that marks the active mode. The menu is
                  not a drawer: it is a sheet of paper laid over the site,
                  ruled like a ledger, entries settling in one beat apart.
                  A skip link waits above everything for the keyboard;
                  press Tab from the very top of the page to meet it. The
                  logo is the wordmark, a breadcrumb trails in the mono
                  ledger voice, and the eyebrow sits above every section
                  title on this page, this one included.
                  </p>
